<v Thomas>我说她向我射击因为——

00:42:59.020 --> 00:43:15.550
<v Richard Gordy>OK. That's OK. Listen to me real quick here. All I need to know is if she did or she didn't. If she didn't, that's fine. If it's a dispute, we'll handle that. But if she really did, make sure you're telling the truth, because if you're not, you'll be charged, OK? So did she or did she not? Because I'm getting ready to--
<v Richard Gordy>好吧。没关系。快速听我说。我只需要知道她是做了还是没做。如果她没做，那也很好。如果是纠纷，我们会处理。但如果她真的做了，确保你在说实话，因为如果你没做，你会被起诉，好吗？所以她是做了还是没做？因为我准备——

