00:45:26.660 --> 00:45:52.660
<v Brian Reed>For obvious reasons, officers are focusing on whether or not there was a gun involved in whatever happened during this dispute. Outside, the cops ask Thomas over and over, all different ways, if there had been a gun, if he'd seen a gun, if a gun had been fired. They do the same thing with Thomas's girlfriend, Trina. Again, these are the people who asked for the cops to help them. Officer Gordy takes Trina out back to the parking lot and has her act out how it went down.
<v Brian Reed>出于显而易见的原因，警察正专注于无论这起纠纷期间发生了什么，是否涉及枪支。在外面，警察一遍又一遍地问 Thomas，各种方式，如果有一把枪，如果他看到了一把枪，如果一把枪被发射了。他们对 Thomas 的女朋友 Trina 也做了同样的事情。再次，这些是要求警察帮助的人。戈迪警官带 Trina 出去后面到停车场，让她演示发生了什么。

